sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Prover (offchain)
  participant V as Mock verifier program
  participant C as VerifiedContext (verifier-owned)
  participant A as Privacy application
  participant N as Nullifier PDA
  participant S as PrivacyState

  Note over P: secret, salt, amount and Merkle path stay private
  P->>V: verify_fixture(root, nullifier, output, domain)
  V->>C: create context bound to public inputs
  P->>A: consume_note(public inputs + context)
  A->>A: validate verifier ID, context owner and every field
  A->>N: init PDA ["nullifier", nullifier]
  A->>S: record output commitment / state transition
  Note over A,S: Any failure rolls back the whole transaction
